# Yahpaz conventions

- Hebrew-only UI, full RTL (`lang=he`, `dir=rtl`)
- Stack: Vite + React + TS, Supabase (Auth/Postgres/RLS), Netlify, Resend (pending domain slot)
- Roles: `admin` | `shift_lead` | `responder` (combo allowed)
- Events: event-level fields + per-responder `event_responders`; viewer-relative status
- Visual language: **"רשומה" (Official Record) design system — single source of truth: `design-system-design-instructions/`** (read `00-how-to-use.md` first, follow its contract). The old hebrew-card-manager / Responders TLV reference is dead — do not use it.
- Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-09-yahpaz-volunteers-events-design.md`
- Do not commit secrets (`.env.local`, API tokens pasted in chat)
- Do not kill/restart the user's localhost Vite server — see `localhost-dev-server.mdc`
- Small tasks: implement directly; skip spec/plan/brainstorm — see `small-tasks-just-implement.mdc`
